msgstr "Il purschider ha respundì %(status)s."

#: src/postulo/core/mail_auth.py
msgid "The provider sent no refresh token, so mail would stop within the hour. Check that offline access is allowed for this application."
msgstr "Il purschider n'ha tramess nagin refresh token, perquai smettess l'e-mail da funcziunar entaifer in'ura. Controllai che l'access offline è permess per questa applicaziun."

#: src/postulo/plugins/consent.py
msgid "The provider will not renew this. Somebody has to agree to it again."
msgstr "Il purschider na renovescha betg quai. Insatgi sto puspè dar ses consentiment."

#: src/postulo/plugins/consent.py
msgid "The provider's reply was not readable."
msgstr "La resposta dal purschider n'era betg legibla."

#: src/postulo/plugins/consent.py
msgid "The provider's token address redirected, and Postulo does not follow it."
msgstr "L'adressa da token dal purschider ha renvià, e Postulo na suonda betg quai."

#: src/postulo/applications/forms.py
msgid "The public employment service you are registered with. Add it under Companies, as a public employment service, if it is not here."
msgstr "L'uffizi da lavur public tar il qual Vus essas registrà. Agiuntai el sut Interpresas, sco uffizi da lavur public, sch'el n'è betg qua."

#: src/postulo/core/models.py
msgid "The public key every archive is encrypted to before it leaves, starting age1. Keep the identity that opens them somewhere other than this server."
msgstr "La clav publica per la quala mintga archiv vegn criptà avant ch'el banduna il server, cumenzond cun age1. Conservai l'identitad ch'als avra insanua auter che sin quest server."

#: src/postulo/resume/candidate.py
msgid "The publication it counts cannot be added, so it will be a count for all of your work."
msgstr "La publicaziun a la quala el sa referescha na po betg vegnir agiuntada, perquai vegn quai in dumber per tut Vossas publicaziuns."

#: src/postulo/resume/candidate.py
msgid "The publication it counts is not in the file, so it will be a count for all of your work."
msgstr "La publicaziun a la quala el sa referescha n'è betg en la datoteca, perquai vegn quai in dumber per tut Vossas publicaziuns."

#: src/postulo/applications/views.py
msgid "The reason was not kept: only an application that was rejected, withdrawn or ghosted has one."
msgstr "Il motiv n'è betg vegnì conservà: mo ina candidatura refusada, retratga u senza resposta ha in motiv."

