#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
msgid "Yes: a person may have a picture of the whole page kept, sent by their browser extension or drawn here from the kept source with scripts and the network off. A picture taken in somebody's browser shows the page as they were seeing it, signed in or not. No, or not set: nobody's captures keep one."
msgstr "Gea: ina persuna po laschar conservar in maletg da l'entira pagina, tramess da sia extensiun dal navigatur u generà qua a basa dal code funtauna conservà, cun scripts e rait deactivads. In maletg fatg en il navigatur d'insatgi mussa la pagina sco ch'el la veseva, annunzià u betg. Na, u betg definì: nagina captura na conserva in maletg."

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
msgid "Yes: a person may have the page's source kept beside what was read from it, exactly as it was parsed, so that a capture can be checked against it and read again by a better parser. It is kept as text and never shown as a page. No, or not set: nobody's captures keep it, whatever they have chosen."
msgstr "Gea: ina persuna po laschar conservar il code funtauna da la pagina sper quai ch'è vegnì legì or dad el, exactamain sco ch'el è vegnì analisà, per che la captura possia vegnir verifitgada cun el e legida danovamain d'in meglier analisader. El vegn conservà sco text e mai mussà sco pagina. Na, u betg definì: nagina captura na conserva el, independentamain da tge che la persuna ha tschernì."

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
msgid "Yes: anyone who finds the address may create an account. No: invitation only. An empty instance always offers the sign-up form, so somebody can become the first account."
msgstr "Gea: tgi che chatta l'adressa po crear in conto. Na: mo cun invitaziun. In'instanza vida porscha adina il formular da registraziun, uschia ch'insatgi po daventar l'emprim conto."

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
msgid "Yes: somebody who arrives through the identity provider is signed straight in, without being asked for a code as well. Say yes only if you know that provider checks identity at least as carefully as Postulo would. It never applies to a password sign-in, and it removes nobody's authenticator app. A passkey already counts on its own and needs no setting."
msgstr "Gea: insatgi ch'arriva via il purschider d'identitad vegn annunzià directamain, senza ch'el stoppia er endatar in code. Tschernai gea mo sche Vus savais che quest purschider controllescha l'identitad almain uschè bain sco Postulo. Quai na vala mai per in'annunzia cun pled-clav, e quai n'allontanescha l'app d'autentificaziun da nagin. Ina clav d'access vala gia sezza e na dovra nagin parameter."

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
msgid "Yes: somebody who has forgotten their password can ask for a code at their primary address and type it back. A code rather than a link, because mail scanners follow links and would spend one before the person read it. It is never a second factor: an authenticator app is still asked for. Offered only while this instance's mail is actually getting through."
msgstr "Gea: insatgi che ha emblidà ses pled-clav po dumandar in code a sia adressa principala e l'endatar. In code e betg ina colliaziun, perquai che scanners dad e-mail suondan colliaziuns e las consumassan avant che la persuna las ha legidas. Quai n'è mai in segund factur: in'app d'autentificaziun vegn tuttina dumandada. Purschì mo uschè ditg che l'e-mail da questa instanza arriva effectivamain."

